   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I originally posted this issue with readr, but was told this might be a better forum.  See here:<div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://github.com/hadley/readr/issues/491\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/hadley/readr/issues/491&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792392714164000&amp;usg=AOvVaw37TlxjHc7FJPGsU9HBItcM\">https://github.com/hadley/readr/issues/491</a><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">I&#39;m trying to get the automatic file decompression of readr working in a shiny app, but I&#39;m running into some issues. Here&#39;s a MWE for the app and two example files are:</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"><a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/gdw6piyitsbpwbe/mtcars.csv?dl=1\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,120,192);background-color:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.dropbox.com/s/gdw6piyitsbpwbe/mtcars.csv?dl%3D1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792392714164000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2FA5owjBTZnh0ogBTxNxPy\">mtcars.csv</a><br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/1uu1jyg7q5kgce8/mtcars.zip?dl=1\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,120,192);background-color:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.dropbox.com/s/1uu1jyg7q5kgce8/mtcars.zip?dl%3D1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792392714164000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ySpZnLwLVBGcqHLkmScS_\">mtcars.zip</a></p><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;overflow:visible!important\"><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.9px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:1.45;word-wrap:normal;padding:16px;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;word-break:normal;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">library(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">shiny</span>)\r\nlibrary(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">readr</span>)\r\n\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">ui</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&lt;-</span> fluidPage(\r\n   titlePanel(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span>Test upload<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span></span>),\r\n   sidebarLayout(\r\n      sidebarPanel(\r\n        fileInput(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&#39;</span>file1<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&#39;</span></span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&#39;</span>Upload csv file or zipped csv file<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&#39;</span></span>)\r\n      ),\r\n      mainPanel(\r\n         tableOutput(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span>tabOut<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span></span>)\r\n      )\r\n   )\r\n)\r\n\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(121,93,163)\">server</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">function</span>(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">input</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">output</span>) {\r\n   <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">output</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">$</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">tabOut</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&lt;-</span> renderTable({\r\n     <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">inFile</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">input</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">$</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">file1</span>\r\n     validate(\r\n       need(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">!</span>is.null(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">input</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">$</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">file1</span>), <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span>Please upload a data file<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span></span>)\r\n     )\r\n     <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">dat</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&lt;-</span> read_csv(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">inFile</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">$</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">datapath</span>)\r\n     <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">return</span>(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">dat</span>)\r\n   })\r\n}\r\n\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(150,152,150)\"># Run the application </span>\r\nshinyApp(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(237,106,67)\">ui</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">ui</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(237,106,67)\">server</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">server</span>)</pre></div><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">I would expect the app to return the same result, whether the file uploaded was a csv or a zipped version of the csv, much like</p><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;overflow:visible!important\"><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.9px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:1.45;word-wrap:normal;padding:16px;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;word-break:normal;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">read_csv(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span>mtcars.zip<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span></span>)</pre></div><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">and</p><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;overflow:visible!important\"><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.9px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:1.45;word-wrap:normal;padding:16px;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;word-break:normal;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">read_csv(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span>mtcars.csv<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">&quot;</span></span>)</pre></div><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">return the same object. However, when I upload a zipped csv file, in the shiny app it returns the error: <code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.9px;padding-top:0.2em;padding-bottom:0.2em;border-radius:3px;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.0392157)\">Error: input string 2 is invalid UTF-8</code> and in the console it returns:</p><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.9px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:1.45;word-wrap:normal;padding:16px;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;color:rgb(51,51,51);background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.9px;border-radius:3px;word-break:normal;display:inline;overflow:visible;line-height:inherit;word-wrap:normal;background:transparent\">&gt; runApp()\r\n\r\nListening on <a href=\"http://127.0.0.1:6254\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://127.0.0.1:6254&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792392714164000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ZW1kbDWxkQphYjv_3Ciwr\">http://127.0.0.1:6254</a>\r\nParsed with column specification:\r\ncols(\r\n  `PK���` = col_character()\r\n)\r\nWarning: 4 parsing failures.\r\nrow            col expected        actual\r\n  1 PK���          embedded null\r\n  5 PK���          embedded null\r\n  7 PK���          embedded null\r\n  8 PK���          embedded null\r\n\r\nWarning: Error in gsub: input string 2 is invalid UTF-8\r\nStack trace (innermost first):\r\n    86: gsub\r\n    85: sanitize\r\n    84: print.xtable\r\n    83: &lt;Anonymous&gt;\r\n    82: do.call\r\n    81: eval\r\n    80: eval\r\n    79: withVisible\r\n    78: evalVis\r\n    77: utils::capture.output\r\n    76: paste\r\n    75: origRenderFunc\r\n    74: output$tabOut\r\n     1: runApp\r\n</code></pre><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">My session info:</p><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.9px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:1.45;word-wrap:normal;padding:16px;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;color:rgb(51,51,51);background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.9px;border-radius:3px;word-break:normal;display:inline;overflow:visible;line-height:inherit;word-wrap:normal;background:transparent\">&gt; devtools::session_info()\r\nSession info -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n setting  value                       \r\n version  R version 3.3.1 (2016-06-21)\r\n system   x86_64, darwin13.4.0        \r\n ui       RStudio (0.99.1266)         \r\n language (EN)                        \r\n collate  en_AU.UTF-8                 \r\n tz       Australia/Sydney            \r\n date     2016-07-24                  \r\n\r\nPackages -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n package    * version     date       source                        \r\n assertthat   0.1         2013-12-06 CRAN (R 3.3.0)                \r\n devtools     1.12.0      2016-06-24 CRAN (R 3.3.0)                \r\n digest       0.6.9       2016-01-08 CRAN (R 3.3.0)                \r\n htmltools    0.3.5       2016-03-21 CRAN (R 3.3.0)                \r\n httpuv       1.3.3       2015-08-04 CRAN (R 3.3.0)                \r\n jsonlite     1.0         2016-07-01 CRAN (R 3.3.0)                \r\n memoise      1.0.0       2016-01-29 CRAN (R 3.3.0)                \r\n mime         0.5         2016-07-07 CRAN (R 3.3.0)                \r\n R6           2.1.2       2016-01-26 CRAN (R 3.3.0)                \r\n Rcpp         0.12.6      2016-07-19 cran (@0.12.6)                \r\n readr      * 0.2.2.9000  2016-07-24 Github (hadley/readr@8b1b81b) \r\n rsconnect    0.4.3       2016-05-02 CRAN (R 3.3.0)                \r\n shiny      * 0.13.2.9004 2016-07-24 Github (rstudio/shiny@28547e9)\r\n tibble       1.1         2016-07-04 CRAN (R 3.3.0)                \r\n withr        1.0.2       2016-06-20 CRAN (R 3.3.0)                \r\n xtable       1.8-2       2016-02-05 CRAN (R 3.3.0) </code></pre></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><b>Hadley&#39;s response:</b></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">Readr uses the extension to determine if the file is compressed or not. I think you&#39;ll need to ask on the shiny mailing list to figure out why it&#39;s getting lost.</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">Any help would be greatly appreciated.</span></div></div>"
