    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I&#39;ve found a solution that involves manually renaming the file.</div><div><br></div><div>Replace:</div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"padding:16px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.9px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:1.45;word-wrap:normal;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;word-break:normal;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">     dat <span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&lt;-</span> read_csv(inFile<span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">$</span>datapath)\r\n     <span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">return</span>(dat)</pre></div><div><br></div><div>with:</div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">input_file_format &lt;- tools::file_ext(inFile$name)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">new_file_name&lt;-paste0(inFile$datapath,&quot;.&quot;,input_file_format)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">file.rename(inFile$datapath, new_file_name)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">dat = readr::read_csv(new_file_name)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">return(dat)</font></div></div></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Not sure if this is the best approach, but it&#39;s working for now.</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br>On Monday, 25 July 2016 08:56:12 UTC+10, Garth Tarr  wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">I originally posted this issue with readr, but was told this might be a better forum.  See here:<div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://github.com/hadley/readr/issues/491\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/hadley/readr/issues/491&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792392714172000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2nvw_xLjIbVi3s9R3AMNIF\">https://github.com/hadley/readr/issues/491</a><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">I&#39;m trying to get the automatic file decompression of readr working in a shiny app, but I&#39;m running into some issues. Here&#39;s a MWE for the app and two example files are:</p><p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\"><a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/gdw6piyitsbpwbe/mtcars.csv?dl=1\" style=\"color:rgb(64,120,192);background-color:transparent\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.dropbox.com/s/gdw6piyitsbpwbe/mtcars.csv?dl%3D1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792392714172000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2-2MWWXJwAo5TJpyR380r7\">mtcars.csv</a><br><a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/1uu1jyg7q5kgce8/mtcars.zip?dl=1\" style=\"color:rgb(64,120,192);background-color:transparent\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.dropbox.com/s/1uu1jyg7q5kgce8/mtcars.zip?dl%3D1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792392714172000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0kk9Ib1lTRxKgrbLbo8C6D\">mtcars.zip</a></p><div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;overflow:visible!important\"><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.9px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:1.45;word-wrap:normal;padding:16px;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;word-break:normal;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">library(<span>shiny</span>)\r\nlibrary(<span>readr</span>)\r\n\r\n<span>ui</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&lt;-</span> fluidPage(\r\n   titlePanel(<span style=\"color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span>&quot;</span>Test upload<span>&quot;</span></span>),\r\n   sidebarLayout(\r\n      sidebarPanel(\r\n        fileInput(<span style=\"color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span>&#39;</span>file1<span>&#39;</span></span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span>&#39;</span>Upload csv file or zipped csv file<span>&#39;</span></span>)\r\n      ),\r\n      mainPanel(\r\n         tableOutput(<span style=\"color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span>&quot;</span>tabOut<span>&quot;</span></span>)\r\n      )\r\n   )\r\n)\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(121,93,163)\">server</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">function</span>(<span>input</span>, <span>output</span>) {\r\n   <span>output</span><span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">$</span><span>tabOut</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&lt;-</span> renderTable({\r\n     <span>inFile</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&lt;-</span> <span>input</span><span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">$</span><span>file1</span>\r\n     validate(\r\n       need(<span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">!</span>is.null(<span>input</span><span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">$</span><span>file1</span>), <span style=\"color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span>&quot;</span>Please upload a data file<span>&quot;</span></span>)\r\n     )\r\n     <span>dat</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&lt;-</span> read_csv(<span>inFile</span><span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">$</span><span>datapath</span>)\r\n     <span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">return</span>(<span>dat</span>)\r\n   })\r\n}\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(150,152,150)\"># Run the application </span>\r\nshinyApp(<span style=\"color:rgb(237,106,67)\">ui</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span> <span>ui</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(237,106,67)\">server</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span> <span>server</span>)</pre></div><p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px;line-height:21px\">I would expect the app to return the same result, whether the file uploaded was a csv or a zipped version of the csv, much like</p><div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;overflow:visible!important\"><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.9px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:1.45;word-wrap:normal;padding:16px;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;word-break:normal;background-color:rgb(247,247,247)\">read_csv(<span style=\"color:rgb(24,54,145)\"><span>&quot;</span>mtcars.zip<span>&quot;</span></span>)</pre></div><p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe 